CM 160M DIPOLE WITH 1:1 CURRENT BALUN (FT-240-43×2 STACKED)
CM Purpose: Demonstrate common-mode suppression effect of 1:1 ferrite choke
CM Antenna: Symmetric dipole, feedpoint impedance ~73Ω (resonant)
CM Balun: FT-240-43×2 stacked, 14 turns RG-58 through core
CM Expected: 20+ dB CM suppression, clean radiation pattern
CM Antenna geometry (270-foot dipole @ 50 feet height)
CM Dipole spans from -135 to +135 feet horizontally
CM Feedpoint impedance source at center (segment near 0,0,50)
CM Frequency sweep: 1.8 MHz (160M fundamental)
CM Voltage source: 1V applied at feedpoint
CM Radiation pattern calculation
